<title>USA: Mt. Diablo USD, Calif., won by Prudential.</title>
<headline>Mt. Diablo USD, Calif., won by Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities said it won $34.3 million of Mount Diablo Unified Sch Dist Community Facilities District No. 1, Calif. Series 1996 special tax bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.777 percent.</p>
